# Season 01: Lithography & Semiconductor Manufacturing Core (1–25)

1. **EUV Light Source:** Sn target plasma conversion efficiency (>6%) and debris contamination control.
2. **EUV Mirrors:** Mo/Si multilayer film (>100 layers) with atomic-level interface roughness (<0.2nm).
3. **Dual Wafer Stages:** Nanometer-level (<1nm) synchronous motion and Abbe error compensation.
4. **Vacuum Systems:** >10⁻⁸ Pa cleanliness and hydrocarbon contamination control.
5. **Grating Interferometers:** Picometer-level (<10pm) displacement measurement and thermal drift suppression.
6. **ALD Reaction Chambers:** Precursor pulse uniformity and step coverage (>99%).
7. **Ion Implantation:** Beam current (>10mA) uniformity (<0.5%) and energy contamination (<0.1%).
8. **CMP Equipment:** Polishing pressure (<1psi) accuracy and real-time pad wear compensation.
9. **Defect Inspection:** High-speed imaging (>1000 wph) of >10nm defects and AI-based auto-classification.
10. **Flip-Chip Bonding:** Cu pillar coplanarity (<1μm) and underfill flow control.
11. **EUV Photoresist:** Chemically amplified resist resolution (<13nm) and line-edge roughness (LER <2nm).
12. **ArF Immersion Photoresist:** Long-term suppression of water marks and bubble-induced immersion defects.
13. **300mm Silicon Wafers:** Bulk oxygen content (<10ppb) and radial resistivity uniformity (<1%).
14. **EUV Mask Substrates:** Ultra-low thermal expansion glass ceramics (CTE < ±30ppb/K).
15. **High-Purity Specialty Gases:** NF₃ purity >99.999% with trace metal impurities <0.1ppb.
16. **Sputtering Targets:** High-purity Ta targets (>99.995%) grain orientation and global thin-film uniformity.
17. **CMP Consumables:** Pad micropore structure (>50μm) and groove hydrodynamic optimization.
18. **EDA Full-Flow Signoff:** Parasitic parameter extraction for 7nm and GAA architectures.
19. **OPC Computational Lithography:** Global optimal solution for sub-resolution assist features (SRAF).
20. **High-Performance CPU/GPU:** Breaking the power wall constraint in out-of-order execution microarchitectures.
21. **MLCC Thin-Layer Ceramics:** <1μm dielectric layers and Ni electrode co-firing compatibility.
22. **FPGA Massive Routing:** LUT interconnect delay and routing congestion balance.
23. **Aero Engine Single-Crystal Blades:** Directional solidification temperature gradient (>100K/cm) and stray grain suppression.
24. **SiC/SiC Ceramic Matrix Composites (CMC):** Hi-Nicalon fiber BN oxidation-resistant coating.
25. **Ultra-Precision P4 Angular Contact Bearings:** Adaptive preload and high-speed thermal elongation compensation.

